{"id":7879,"date":"2019-06-17T11:05:07","date_gmt":"2019-06-17T07:05:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?post_type=news_item&#038;p=7879"},"modified":"2019-10-07T15:06:33","modified_gmt":"2019-10-07T11:06:33","slug":"offshore-technology-conference-2019","status":"publish","type":"news_item","link":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/news_item\/offshore-technology-conference-2019\/","title":{"rendered":"Offshore Technology Conference 2019"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every year energy industry professionals gather at the Offshore Technology Conference(OTC) to share and grow their knowledge of onshore, offshore and subsea operations,focusing on process improvement and innovation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Worldwide Oilfield Machine (WOM) brought its premium product line, and demonstrated its versatility through recent developments such as: Frac Valve, <a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/product\/subsea-intervention-system\/\">Deepwater Riser System (DRS)<\/a>, Compact Cutting Device(CCD), <a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/product\/torque-reducer-gate-valve\/\">Torque Reducer<\/a>, and the <a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/product\/replaceable-seat-seal-assembly\/\">Replaceable Seat for BOP<\/a>. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"945\" height=\"655\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6398 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"945\" height=\"655\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6398\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference.jpg 945w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference-300x208.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OffShoreTechnology-Conference-768x532.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 945px) 100vw, 945px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">WOM was proud to exhibit the Deepwater Riser System (DRS), which provides class leading safe, efficient subsea well access for installation, production enhancement, well repair, and decommissioning operations. Asset value is maximized through maintenance and IOR with flexible deployment opportunities from dedicated vessels and MODU vessels on a worldwide basis.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-3.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-3.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7884\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7884\" class=\"wp-image-7884 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7884\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7884\" class=\"wp-image-7884\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-3.jpg 352w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-3-226x300.jpg 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 352px) 100vw, 352px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-2.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7885\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7885\" class=\"wp-image-7885 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7885\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7885\" class=\"wp-image-7885\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-2.jpg 352w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-2-226x300.jpg 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 352px) 100vw, 352px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-1.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7886\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7886\" class=\"wp-image-7886 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"352\" height=\"468\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7886\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7886\" class=\"wp-image-7886\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-1.jpg 352w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC2019-1-226x300.jpg 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 352px) 100vw, 352px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> WOM also presented some of its premium products lines, Ball Valves, Blowout Preventers and DRS &#8211; Deepwater Riser System, highlighting all of their features and benefits. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\"><p>\u201cWOM has sold thousands of ball valves to major pipeline companies, with installations in many environments such as the North Sea, Gulf of Mexico, Middle East, South Asia and Canada. In the USA Dual-Seal customers along the Gulf Coast use our valve for handling crude oil; in the major basins these valves are used in refined products pipelines, gathering systems, and major transmission lines carrying shale gas to market.\u201d<\/p><cite>&#8211;  BILL LANNING <br><strong>API 6D Product Manager<\/strong><\/cite><\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-4 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC7.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"333\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC7.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7880\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7880\" class=\"wp-image-7880 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"333\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC7.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7880\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?attachment_id=7880\" class=\"wp-image-7880\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC7.jpg 600w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/OTC7-300x167.jpg 300w\"